WolffBot
========

WolffBot is a modified fork of DASAI Mochi by upiir.

Original project
----------------
  Name:       DASAI Mochi (esp32s3_oled_dasai_mochi)
  Author:     upiir  <https://www.youtube.com/upir_upir>
  Repository: https://github.com/upiir/esp32s3_oled_dasai_mochi
  Commit:     71ecb80e27af6f94aa453fe98e25a8bb557a7f18 (2025-03-25)
  Licence:    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 upir

The firmware in firmware/WolffBot/WolffBot.ino is upir's work. The only change
made to it is an added comment header identifying the fork and its attribution;
no line of the original was removed or altered. A verbatim copy of the upstream
repository, including its own LICENSE and README, is kept in
original/esp32s3_oled_dasai_mochi/.

The LICENSE file at the root of this repository is the unmodified upstream MIT
License and must be distributed with the software. Modifications made for
WolffBot are released under the same MIT License.


